# The tree diagram `ME8B`

[mild] Lemma 2.1, Case II: the `Ẽ₈` tree `z₁ ← x ← x'' → t ← z → y ← y' ← t'`, `x'' → z₂`.

Generated by `scripts/gen_tree_shape.py`.
